---
layout: layout.njk
title: Applications | Lloyd Security
description: Apply to join the Lloyd Security team with our simple application form.
bodyClass: applications-page
headerClass: system-header
permalink: applications.html
---
<section class="applications-hero system-hero">
  <div class="system-hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="system-hero-copy">
    <p class="section-kicker">Careers / Lloyd Security</p>
    <h1>Start your<br /><em>application.</em></h1>
    <p>Tell us a little about yourself, choose the position that interests you, and let your resume do some of the talking.</p>
  </div>
  <span class="system-page-index">02 / 02</span>
</section>

<section class="application-content">
  <div class="application-intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">Join the growing team</p>
    <h2>A simple first<br /><span>step forward.</span></h2>
    <p>Upload your resume to autofill the form, or complete the application manually. You’ll have a chance to review everything before it is sent.</p>
    <div class="application-notes">
      <p><span class="process-number">01</span><strong>Choose a position</strong></p>
      <p><span class="process-number">02</span><strong>Upload and review</strong></p>
      <p><span class="process-number">03</span><strong>Send your application</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-panel application-form-panel">
    <p class="section-kicker">Application form</p>
    <form class="contact-form" action="https://formsubmit.co/sage@lloydsecurity.com" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Lloyd Security job application" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
      <input class="form-trap" type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label><span>Your name</span><input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
        <label><span>Email address</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
      </div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label><span>Phone <small>Optional</small></span><input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" /></label>
        <label><span>Position applying for</span><select id="application-position" name="position" required><option value="" disabled selected>Select a position</option><option>Technician</option><option>Accounting Associate</option></select></label>
      </div>
      <label><span>Company or current employer <small>Optional</small></span><input type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization" /></label>
      <label class="resume-picker"><span>Upload resume <small>Optional / sent with your application</small></span><input id="resume-file" type="file" name="attachment" accept=".pdf,.docx,.txt" /></label>
      <p class="resume-status" id="resume-status" role="status">Your resume will be attached to the email when you submit.</p>
      <label><span>Tell us a little more</span><textarea name="message" rows="7" required placeholder="Share a little about your experience and why this position interests you."></textarea></label>
      <div class="form-footer"><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Submit application <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="form-status" role="status">We’ll review your application and follow up with next steps.</p></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="application-privacy">
  <p class="section-kicker">Before you send</p>
  <p>Your resume is read in your browser to help fill the form. When you submit, the file and the information you review are sent to Lloyd Security.</p>
</section>
